se (1.0~beta4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix a segfault with 26 PREFHOST entries and a stdin buffer overflow.
  * Fix the long options table and validate numeric arguments.
  * Rewrite the fuzzy host matching without leaks.
  * Support the Include directive of ssh_config.
  * Drop the libbsd dependency.
  * Document -l, -s and Include in the man pages.
  * Modernize the packaging: debhelper-compat 13, hardening flags,
    Standards-Version 4.6.2, run the test suite at build time.

 -- Emilien Mantel <emilien.mantel@debianiste.org>  Thu, 10 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0200

